Parity helper `load_game_lod_ini_presets_and_options` exists (`Common/src/common/game_lod.rs:489-560`) but is only called from unused crate `GameEngine::init` (`Common/src/common/game_engine.rs:417`).

Live boot is `CnCGameEngine::new` (`Main/src/cnc_game_engine/boot.rs`). Grep of `GeneralsRust/Code/Main` finds **zero** `load_game_lod_ini_presets_and_options` / `GameLOD.ini` / `init_game_lod_manager` calls.

Live `apply_live_draw_dynamic_lod` (`run_loop.rs:951-954`) reads `get_game_lod_manager()`, which lazy-inits an empty default manager (no INI, no Options.ini, no `setStaticLODLevel`).

