`PlaceEventTranslator::translateGameMessage` (`GeneralsMD/Code/GameEngine/Source/GameClient/MessageStream/PlaceEventTranslator.cpp:269-284`). On `isLocationLegalToBuild != LBC_OK` it: displays `displayCantBuildMessage(lbc)`, plays the builder template `VoiceNoBuild` per-unit sound, plays UI `NoCanDoSound`, then unhooks the placement anchor with `setPlacementStart(NULL)` so the player can retry.

