`PlaceEventTranslator::translateGameMessage` (`PlaceEventTranslator.cpp:166-197`) re-checks `TheBuildAssistant->canMakeUnit(builderObj, build)` on click-up. `CANMAKE_NO_MONEY` plays `TheEva->setShouldPlay(EVA_InsufficientFunds)` plus `GUI:NotEnoughMoneyToBuild` and keeps placement armed. Queue-full / parking-full / maxed-out show the matching GUI string. Other failures cancel placement via `placeBuildAvailable(NULL,NULL)`.

